# Buddy pairing links (D174).
#
# https://simpleprayer.app/b/ABCD2345 is an invite. On a phone with the app installed, iOS and
# Android hand the URL straight to the app and this file is never consulted — that is what the
# two files in .well-known/ are for. This rule is the other case: somebody who does not have the
# app yet, or who opened the link on a computer. They get the install page, and the link works
# when they come back to it.
#
# The code is deliberately dropped rather than carried through. It is a one-time pairing secret,
# and a web page has no use for it — passing it into a query string would put it in browser
# history, in the referrer of anything the page links to, and in any analytics the visitor's own
# browser does. The app reads it from the URL directly.
/b/*    /install    302
